 "doc_type": "Sales Invoice",
 "docstatus": 0,
 "doctype": "Print Format",
 "font_size": 10,
 "html": "<style>\n    @font-face {\n        font-family: 'Niradei';\n        src: url('/assets/klik_pos/fonts/Niradei-Regular.woff2') format('woff2');\n        font-weight: normal;\n        font-style: normal;\n    }\n    @font-face {\n        font-family: 'Niradei';\n        src: url('/assets/klik_pos/fonts/Niradei-SemiBold.woff2') format('woff2');\n        font-weight: 600;\n        font-style: normal;\n    }\n    @font-face {\n        font-family: 'Niradei';\n        src: url('/assets/klik_pos/fonts/Niradei-Bold.woff2') format('woff2');\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-style: normal;\n    }\n    @font-face {\n        font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light';\n        src: url('/assets/klik_pos/fonts/KhmerOSmuollight.ttf') format('truetype');\n        font-weight: normal;\n        font-style: normal;\n    }\n    @font-face {\n        font-family: 'Khmer OS Battambang';\n        src: url('/assets/klik_pos/fonts/KhmerOSbattambang.ttf') format('truetype');\n        font-weight: normal;\n        font-style: normal;\n    }\n\n    /* Defensive reset - this template is rendered inside Frappe's .print-format-gutter >\n       .print-format wrapper (print.bundle.css, which imports bootstrap), for all three\n       consumers: the browser printview, the POS preview panel, and frappe.get_print(as_pdf=True)\n       used for the Telegram image. Never rely on inherited sizing/spacing from that wrapper. */\n    .print-format-gutter, .print-format {\n        margin: 0 !important;\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        background: none !important;\n        box-shadow: none !important;\n    }\n\n    /* Real @page rule - honored by actual browsers (the printview \"Print\" button, and the\n       cashier's own Ctrl+P). Chrome and Firefox both respect this at print time. */\n    @page {\n        size: 148mm 210mm;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Frappe's PDF pipeline (both wkhtmltopdf and its own \"chrome\" pdf_generator) does NOT read\n       the @page rule above - frappe/utils/pdf.py's read_options_from_html() / browser.py's\n       _parse_pdf_options_from_html() instead scrape a handful of non-standard properties off a\n       CSS rule whose selector is *exactly* \".print-format\", and browser.py hardcodes a 15mm\n       left/right margin fallback whenever page-width/page-height aren't found this way. Real\n       browsers simply ignore these bogus property names on a real selector, so this rule is safe\n       to ship - it does nothing outside Frappe's own PDF generation.\n\n       page-size: A5 is required too, not just cosmetic - without it, frappe/utils/pdf.py's\n       _set_default_page_size() injects \"page-size: A4\" (from Print Settings) alongside our\n       page-width/page-height. wkhtmltopdf's *output page* still comes out physically correct\n       (explicit width/height win there), but it lays out the HTML content itself against A4's\n       wider internal viewport reference and then squeezes that onto the declared A5 page,\n       uniformly shrinking every element - this was the actual cause of rows rendering far\n       shorter than their declared height. (\"page-size: Custom\" looks like the \"proper\" fix per\n       that function's own branching, but Frappe's Custom branch never clears the \"page-size\" key\n       it already scraped from this CSS, so the literal string \"Custom\" reaches wkhtmltopdf's CLI\n       and crashes it - \"A5\" is both a valid CLI value and physically identical to our explicit\n       width/height, so it sidesteps that bug entirely.) */\n    .print-format {\n        page-size: A5;\n        page-width: 148mm;\n        page-height: 210mm;\n        margin-top: 0mm;\n        margin-bottom: 0mm;\n        margin-left: 0mm;\n        margin-right: 0mm;\n    }\n\n    .a5-invoice-root, .a5-invoice-root * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .a5-invoice-root {\n        font-family: 'Khmer OS Battambang', 'Niradei', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n\n    /* One .a5-page per 14-item chunk. Deliberately not named \"page-break\" - Frappe's own\n       printview.html looks for exactly that class name and force-styles it. */\n    .a5-page {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 148mm;\n        height: 210mm;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        background: #fff;\n    }\n    .a5-page.a5-page-brk {\n        page-break-after: always;\n        break-after: page;\n    }\n\n    /* --- Header: absolute-positioned blocks, no flex/grid (wkhtmltopdf silently collapses\n       both to plain block boxes - this template must render correctly under either\n       pdf_generator) --- */\n    .header-left {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 8mm;\n        left: 8mm;\n        width: 35mm;\n    }\n    .header-center {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 10mm;\n        left: 45mm;\n        width: 60mm;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n    .qr-center-right {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 10mm;\n        left: 69mm;\n        width: 60mm;\n        text-align: center;\n        z-index: 1;\n    }\n    .header-right {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 8mm;\n        left: 107mm;\n        width: 33mm;\n    }\n\n    .header-left img, .header-right img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: auto;\n        max-height: 25mm;\n        object-fit: cover;\n        display: block;\n        margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .contact-info {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n    .contact-icons {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    .contact-icons img {\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 18px;\n        height: 18px;\n        margin: 0 2px;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .phone-numbers {\n        color: #d91a1a;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n\n    .invoice-badge {\n        border: 1.5px solid #0f9c2e;\n        border-radius: 5px;\n        display: inline-block;\n        padding: 8px 15px 6px;\n        color: #0f9c2e;\n        margin-bottom: 6px;\n        border-bottom: 4px solid #0f9c2e;\n        border-left: 4px solid #0f9c2e;\n    }\n    .invoice-title-km {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light', sans-serif;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    .invoice-title-en {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .business-details {\n        color: #1313a8;\n        font-family: 'Niradei', sans-serif;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .checkbox-group {\n        color: #0f9c2e;\n        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 9.5px;\n        text-align: left;\n        margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .checkbox-item {\n        margin-bottom: 3px;\n    }\n    .checkbox-box {\n        display: inline-block;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        width: 10px;\n        height: 10px;\n        line-height: 9px;\n        text-align: center;\n        border: 1px solid #0f9c2e;\n        margin-right: 4px;\n        font-size: 9px;\n    }\n    .checkbox-item span.label {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    /* --- Subheader: date / N deg on one line, customer on the next --- */\n    .subheader {\n        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 51mm;\n        left: 8mm;\n        width: 132mm;\n        color: #1313a8;\n    }\n    .subheader table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n    }\n    .subheader td {\n        border: none;\n        padding: 0;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        vertical-align: bottom;\n    }\n    .subheader td.invoice-no {\n        text-align: right;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .subheader .customer-row {\n        margin-bottom: 3px;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n\n    /* --- Main table --- */\n    /* top is 51mm (subheader) + enough clearance for its two lines at line-height 1.5 - Khmer\n       script needs generous line-height or stacked vowels/diacritics visually clip into\n       whatever sits below, which is what a too-tight gap here looked like. */\n    .table-container {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 67mm;\n        left: 8mm;\n        width: 132mm;\n    }\n\n    table.items {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        border: 1.5px solid #1313a8;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    /* Root cause of the row-height overhead chased across earlier iterations: Frappe's own\n       print.bundle.css ships \".print-format td, .print-format th { padding: 10px !important; }\"\n       (twice, in fact - 6px then 10px). Since our print format's markup lives inside that exact\n       \".print-format\" wrapper for every rendering path (browser printview, POS preview,\n       frappe.get_print PDF), that !important beats any non-!important padding rule here\n       regardless of selector specificity - it was adding ~5.3mm of unwanted vertical padding to\n       every cell, not a font-metrics or box-sizing quirk as first suspected. Row height still\n       lives on a plain block-level div INSIDE each cell (.td-box/.th-box) rather than on the\n       <td>/<th> itself as further defense-in-depth - a div's `height` is a hard, reliably\n       respected box dimension in every engine, whereas a table cell's own `height` is only ever\n       a minimum the layout engine can pad out further. */\n    table.items th, table.items td {\n        border: 1px solid #1313a8 !important;\n        padding: 0 4px !important;\n    }\n    table.items th {\n        color: #0f9c2e;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .th-box {\n        height: 9mm;\n        line-height: 12px;\n        padding-top: 1.5mm;\n    }\n    .col-no { width: 6%; text-align: center; color: #1313a8; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11px; }\n    .col-name { width: 38%; }\n    .col-qty { width: 14%; text-align: center; }\n    .col-price { width: 18%; text-align: right; }\n    .col-amount { width: 24%; text-align: right; }\n\n    .td-box {\n        height: 6.5mm;\n        line-height: 6.5mm;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n\n    /* \"table.items td.foo-cell\" (not just \".foo-cell\") deliberately - these need to out-specify\n       the \"table.items th, table.items td\" padding reset above, not just match its !important. */\n    table.items td.footer-notes-cell {\n        border-left: none !important;\n        border-bottom: none !important;\n        border-right: none !important;\n        padding: 6px !important;\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n    table.items td.footer-label-cell {\n        border: none !important;\n        text-align: right;\n        color: #0f9c2e;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        padding: 0 8px 0 0 !important;\n        font-size: 10.8px;\n        height: 7mm;\n    }\n    table.items td.footer-value-cell {\n        border: 1px solid #1313a8 !important;\n        text-align: right;\n        padding: 0 6px !important;\n    }\n    .footer-notes {\n        color: #d91a1a;\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .footer-signatures {\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        color: #1313a8;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .footer-signatures table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n    }\n    .footer-signatures td {\n        text-align: center;\n        width: 50%;\n    }\n\n    .continuation-notice {\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #1313a8;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        padding: 6px;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"a5-invoice-root\">\n{% set pages = paginate_invoice_items(doc.items) %}\n{% set customer_phone = doc.contact_mobile or frappe.db.get_value(\"Customer\", doc.customer, \"mobile_no\") %}\n{% set is_delivered = doc.custom_delivery_status == \"Delivered\" %}\n{% set is_pickup = doc.custom_delivery_status == \"Self Pickup\" %}\n{% for page in pages %}\n<div class=\"a5-page{{ '' if page.is_last else ' a5-page-brk' }}\">\n\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/klik_pos/images/invoice_khmer/left.jpg\" alt=\"Steel Products\">\n        <div class=\"contact-info\">\n            <div class=\"contact-icons\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/klik_pos/images/invoice_khmer/phone.png\" alt=\"Phone\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/klik_pos/images/invoice_khmer/telegram.png\" alt=\"Telegram\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"phone-numbers\">\n                092 95 34 24<br>\n                071 9 554 654\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header-center\">\n        <div class=\"invoice-badge\">\n            <div class=\"invoice-title-km\">វិក្កយបត្រ</div>\n            <div class=\"invoice-title-en\">INVOICE</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"business-details\">\n            <div>មានលក់ដែកទីបមូល ជ្រុង ស-ខ្មៅ</div>\n            <div>ដែក V, U, I, H &amp; តោន</div>\n            <div>សង្ក័សីភ្លឺធំ តូច ទ ប្រអប់ គ្រប់ប្រភេទ</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qr-center-right\">\n        {% set qr = get_invoice_qr_png(doc.name) %}\n        {% if qr %}<img src=\"{{ qr }}\" style=\"width: 60px; height: auto;\">{% endif %}\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/klik_pos/images/invoice_khmer/right.jpg\" alt=\"Roofing Products\">\n        <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\n            <div class=\"checkbox-item\">\n                <span class=\"checkbox-box\"></span><span class=\"label\">បានកាត់</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-item\">\n                <span class=\"checkbox-box\">{{ \"✓\" if is_delivered else \"\" }}</span><span class=\"label\">បានដឹក</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-item\">\n                <span class=\"checkbox-box\">{{ \"✓\" if is_pickup else \"\" }}</span><span class=\"label\">បានមកយក</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subheader\">\n        <div class=\"customer-row\">អតិថិជន: {{ doc.customer_name }}{% if customer_phone %} / {{ customer_phone }}{% endif %}</div>\n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td>ថ្ងៃទី {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.posting_date, \"dd\") }} ខែ {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.posting_date, \"mm\") }} ឆ្នាំ{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.posting_date, \"yyyy\") }}</td>\n                <td class=\"invoice-no\">N&#176; {{ doc.name }}</td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table-container\">\n        <table class=\"items\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"col-no\"><div class=\"th-box\"><div>ល.រ</div><div>No</div></div></th>\n                    <th class=\"col-name\"><div class=\"th-box\"><div>មុខទំនិញ</div><div>Name of Goods</div></div></th>\n                    <th class=\"col-qty\"><div class=\"th-box\"><div>ចំនួន</div><div>Quantity</div></div></th>\n                    <th class=\"col-price\"><div class=\"th-box\"><div>តម្លៃរាយ</div><div>Unit Price</div></div></th>\n                    <th class=\"col-amount\"><div class=\"th-box\"><div>តម្លៃសរុប</div><div>Amount</div></div></th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                {% for row in page.rows %}\n                <tr class=\"item-row\">\n                    <td class=\"col-no\"><div class=\"td-box\">{{ row.no }}</div></td>\n                    {% if row.item %}\n                    <td class=\"col-name\"><div class=\"td-box\">{{ row.item.item_name }}</div></td>\n                    <td class=\"col-qty\"><div class=\"td-box\">{{ row.item.qty|int if row.item.qty == row.item.qty|int else row.item.qty }}</div></td>\n                    <td class=\"col-price\"><div class=\"td-box\">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.item.rate, currency=doc.currency) }}</div></td>\n                    <td class=\"col-amount\"><div class=\"td-box\">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.item.amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</div></td>\n                    {% else %}\n                    <td><div class=\"td-box\">&nbsp;</div></td><td><div class=\"td-box\">&nbsp;</div></td><td><div class=\"td-box\">&nbsp;</div></td><td><div class=\"td-box\">&nbsp;</div></td>\n                    {% endif %}\n                </tr>\n                {% endfor %}\n\n                {% if page.is_last %}\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"3\" class=\"footer-notes-cell\">\n                        <div class=\"footer-notes\">\n                            <div style=\"margin-right: 4px;\">បញ្ជាក់ៈ</div>\n                            <div>ដែកទិញហើយមិនអាចដូរយកវិញបានទេ<br>ឥវ៉ាន់មិនទាន់ទូទាត់ជាកម្មសិទ្ធិរបស់ដេប៉ូ</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"footer-signatures\">\n                            <table>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td>អ្នកទិញ / The Buyer</td>\n                                    <td>អ្នកលក់ / The Seller</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </table>\n                        </div>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class=\"footer-label-cell\">សរុប / Total</td>\n                    <td class=\"footer-value-cell\">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.grand_total, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"footer-label-cell\">កក់មុន / Deposit</td>\n                    <td class=\"footer-value-cell\">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.paid_amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"footer-label-cell\">នៅខ្វះ / Balance</td>\n                    <td class=\"footer-value-cell\">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.outstanding_amount, currency=doc.currency) }}</td>\n                </tr>\n                {% else %}\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"continuation-notice\">ទំព័រ {{ page.page_no }}/{{ page.total_pages }} - សូមមើលទំព័របន្ទាប់ / continued on next page</td>\n                </tr>\n                {% endif %}\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n{% endfor %}\n</div>\n",
 "idx": 0,
 "line_breaks": 0,
